#@ Observation datasets: $dataDIR/Data_Observations
#>===========================
  No.01: CNS_AQ_Monitoring_Hourly
  #-----------------------
        ** China National Air Quality Monitoring Data
        -- storage: single site [one file for each site, each year]
            -- date: 2013 to 2025
            -- resolution: hourly
        -- statoins: see "Stations_Info.xlsx"
 

  No.02: CNS_AirQuality_2014-2026
  #-----------------------
        ** China National Air Quality Monitoring Data
        -- address: https://quotsoft.net/air/
        -- storage: all site [one file for all sites, one day]
        -- date: 2014 to 2026
        -- resolution: hourly
        -- stations: see Stations_List/
        -- site: urban [City_site/]  &  non-urban separation [Other_site/]
        ## It includes 24-hour averages for all variables & MDA8 O3.
  
      
  No.03: NOAA_NCEI_GHCNhourly   [## surface Met. observatons; raw data; China]
  #-----------------------
        ** Global Historical Climatology Network hourly (GHCNh)
            -- address: https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/products/global-historical-climatology-network-hourly
            -- raw data format: see documentation in doc/
            -- date: 1970 to 2026 [4/22]
            -- resolution: hourly / 3 hr
            -- codes:
                    * download_ghcnh_byYear.m   [To download China stations by year]
                    * extract_ghcnh_raw.py          [To extract met-variables from raw 'psv' files]
                    * find_stations_plot.py         [To find stations for specific year & region]


  No.04: GHCNh_China_new        [## extracted from the raw GHCNh: NOAA_NCEI_GHCNhourly]
  #-----------------------
        ** Global Historical Climatology Network hourly [China]
        ** Exracted from the raw GHCNh data (NOAA_NCEI_GHCNhourly) using "extract_ghcnh_raw.py"
        -- date: 1970 to 2026 [4/22]
        -- table head:
            #----------------------
            # Date:       obs. date [yyyy-mm-dd HH:MM:SS; UTC];   
            # Lat:        Latitude;  
            # Lon:        Longitude
            # Elev:       obs. height [m];  
            # T[C]:       2-m air temperature [C]; 
            # Td[C]:      dew point temperature [C];
            # Psfc[hPa]:  station level pressure [hPa];    
            # slp[hPa]:   sea level pressure [hPa];
            # RH[%]:      relative humidity [%];   
            # gust[m/s]:  gust wind [m/s];
            # WS[m/s]:    wind speed [m/s];  
            # WD[deg]:    wind direction [deg];
            # Twet[C]:    wet bulb temperature [C]; 
            # vis[km]:    visibility [km];
            # dP3h[hPa]:  3hr pressure change [hPa];   
            # Prec6h[mm]: 6hr precipitation [mm];
            #----------------------
        -- ** WD=999 --> calm wind [it should be deleted .or. you can change it to any degree you want (e.g., 0 / 360).]
    

  No.05: NOAA_IGRA_Sounding   [GPS sounding; China]
  #-----------------------  
    ** Integrated Global Radiosonde Archive (IGRA);  [usually at UTC 00Z & 12Z]
        -- address: https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/products/weather-balloon/integrated-global-radiosonde-archive
                    https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/data/igra/access/data-por/
                    https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/data/igra/access/derived-por/
                    https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/data/igra/doc/igra2-readme.txt
        -- data incl.:
            ## monthly_mean: Monthly means are organized into one file per variable and time of day (0000 and 1200 UTC) [ surface layer + 15 standard pressure levels]
            ## data: Individual soundings, organized into one file per station [see "igra2-data-format.txt"]
            ## derived: Assorted humidity and stability parameters, derived from the IGRA soundings [see "igra2-derived-format.txt"]
            
            ** monthly mean:   all global statons
            ** data / derived: only download for China
        -- stations:
            ## CH: stations of the mainland China
            ## HK: statoins of the Hong Kong, China
            ## TW: stations of the Taiwan, China

        -- Format /Stations info.: see doc/
        -- date: to 2026-04

        ** Last download:  2026-06-04 



